    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/religion_events/head_of_faith_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "@piety_level_3_icon_islam! Of course, how could I say no?",
    "RUS": "@piety_level_3_icon_islam! Разумеется, как я могу отказать?",
    "POL": "@piety_level_3_icon_islam! Oczywiście, jak m[Select_CString( ROOT.Char.IsFemale, 'ogłabym', 'ógłbym' )] odmówić?",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "head_of_faith.0032.b",
    "FILE_PATH": "localization/belarusian/event_localization/religion_events/head_of_faith_events_l_belarusian.json",
    "ENG": "@piety_level_0_icon_islam! Away with you, vile beggars!",
    "RUS": "@piety_level_0_icon_islam! Прочь, гнусные попрошайки!",
    "POL": "@piety_level_0_icon_islam! Precz z wami, podłe żebraki!",
    "BEL": ""
  },
  {
    "KEY": "head_of_faith.0032.notif.a",
